#ASSERT `ch 53 -- full justice is to be granted to the person who complains` `the wardship of lands which are of the fief of another, which the King has had by reason of a fief held of him by knight's service` TRUE TRUE EQUALS Obliged
#ASSERT `ch 53 -- full justice is to be granted to the person who complains` `abbeys founded on other fiefs than the King's own, in which the lord of the fee claims to have right` TRUE TRUE EQUALS Obliged
#ASSERT `ch 53 -- full justice is to be granted to the person who complains` `the wardship of lands which are of the fief of another, which the King has had by reason of a fief held of him by knight's service` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `Obligation not covered`
#ASSERT `ch 53 -- full justice is to be granted to the person who complains` `abbeys founded on other fiefs than the King's own, in which the lord of the fee claims to have right` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `Obligation not covered`
#ASSERT `ch 53 -- full justice is to be granted to the person who complains` `some other matter` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `Obligation not covered`
-- expect: MUST `grant full justice to all who complain of the matters in chapter 53`
