#ASSERT `ch 56 -- the lands, liberties or other things are to be restored to the Welshman` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `Not obliged`
-- RECONCILED 2026-10-30: was "#ASSERT `ch 56 -- the lands, liberties or other things are to be restored to the Welshman` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `Obligation not covered`"; now the text's no, because "without the legal judgment of their peers" is part of the text's own if, and there was a legal judgment.
#ASSERT `ch 56 -- the lands, liberties or other things are to be restored to the Welshman` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `Not obliged`
